          <!-- ======== PANEL 4 · packing ======== -->
          <section class="kvq-panel" data-panel="4">
            <h3 class="kvq-panel-title"><span class="kvq-stepchip">5</span><span class="lang-en">Pack nibbles, pay the header, count the bytes</span><span class="lang-ko">nibble 패킹, header 비용, 바이트 계산</span></h3>

            <p class="kvq-note"><span class="lang-en">Two 4-bit codes share one byte — even channel in the low nibble, odd in the high nibble.</span><span class="lang-ko">4-bit code 두 개가 1 byte를 나눠 쓴다 — 짝수 channel은 low nibble, 홀수 channel은 high nibble.</span></p>
            <div class="kvq-scroll">
              <div class="kvq-pack">
                <div class="kvq-nibrow">
