              </div>
            </div>

            <p class="kvq-note">
              <span class="lang-en">
                On HBM, each group also stores its header. One 128-channel group (the production size
                used below) as a logical record — widths not to scale; real kernels usually keep
                scales/zeros in separate contiguous arrays for coalesced loads:
              </span><span class="lang-ko">
                HBM에는 각 그룹의 header도 함께 저장된다. 아래 저장 산술에 쓰는 production 크기인
                128-channel 그룹 하나를 논리적 record로 그리면 — 폭은 비례가 아니고, 실제
                kernel은 coalesced load를 위해 scale/zero를 보통 별도의 연속 배열에 둔다:
              </span>
            </p>
            <div class="kvq-record" role="img" aria-label="Storage record: 64 bytes of packed codes, 2 bytes scale, 2 bytes zero-point">
              <span class="rec-codes">packed INT4 codes · 128 × 0.5 B = 64 B</span>
              <span class="rec-scale" data-tip="scale s, stored FP16" data-tip-ko="scale s — FP16으로 저장">s · 2 B</span>
              <span class="rec-zero" data-tip="zero-point z (many kernels pack this to 4 bits too)" data-tip-ko="zero-point z (많은 kernel이 이것도 4 bits로 패킹한다)">z · 2 B</span>
            </div>
            <p class="kvq-note"><span class="lang-en">68 B where FP16 needed 256 B → <strong>3.76×</strong>, i.e. <strong>4.25 effective bits</strong> per value.</span><span class="lang-ko">FP16이 256 B 쓰던 것을 68 B로 → <strong>3.76×</strong>, 즉 값당 <strong>4.25 effective bits</strong>.</span></p>

            <div class="kvq-cols even">
              <div class="kvq-scroll">
                <table class="kvq-table">
                  <thead><tr><th>per token (K+V, 32 layers)</th><th>FP16</th><th>INT4, g=128</th></tr></thead>
                  <tbody>
                    <tr><td>element data</td><td>524,288 B</td><td>131,072 B</td></tr>
                    <tr><td>scales + zeros (2,048 groups × 4 B)</td><td>—</td><td>8,192 B</td></tr>
                    <tr><td><strong>total per token</strong></td><td><strong>512 KiB</strong></td><td><strong>136 KiB</strong></td></tr>
                    <tr><td>4,096-token sequence</td><td>2.0 GiB</td><td>544 MiB</td></tr>
                    <tr><td>bits per value</td><td>16.0</td><td>4.25 → <strong>3.76×</strong></td></tr>
                  </tbody>
                </table>
              </div>
              <div class="kvq-scroll">
                <table class="kvq-table">
                  <thead><tr><th>group size g</th><th>header per value</th><th>effective bits</th><th>ratio</th></tr></thead>
                  <tbody>
                    <tr><td>32</td><td>1.00 bit</td><td>5.00</td><td>3.20×</td></tr>
                    <tr><td>64</td><td>0.50 bit</td><td>4.50</td><td>3.56×</td></tr>
                    <tr><td>128</td><td>0.25 bit</td><td>4.25</td><td>3.76×</td></tr>
                    <tr><td>whole tensor</td><td>≈ 0</td><td>4.00</td><td>4.00× <em>(worst error)</em></td></tr>
                  </tbody>
